/*
 * The record shelf: musical settings for each side.
 *
 * Frame data and provenance live in data/records.json (generated by
 * tools/build_library.py). This file holds the artistic decisions — the ones a
 * person made, not a script — so they can be read, argued with, and changed
 * without touching the data pipeline.
 *
 * `axis` is the record's own published colour bar, cool/low end first. It is
 * what converts "average colour" into the physical quantity the record is
 * about, so it must match the legend printed on the visualization.
 */

